Generates an application, a runtime plugin crate, or a tooling plugin program

Usage: leptoskit generate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  app          Generates an application (also available as `leptoskit new`)
  plugin       Generates an independently publishable runtime plugin with an echo method
  tool-plugin  Generates a tooling plugin: a program leptoskit runs once per hook
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
